# Flourish — AI / LLM rules

For all AI and LLM features, we strictly use Firebase Genkit and Vertex AI.

- NEVER use the standard `@google/generative-ai` SDK.
- NEVER expose API keys in the frontend.
- All AI requests must route through a single centralized Genkit flow.
- All Firebase Cloud Functions must use `enforceAppCheck: true`.
- Always implement Google Cloud DLP for PII redaction before sending data to the LLM.
